  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "With **WORLD EATERS** as your Army Faction, as each battle round starts you may roll 8 D6 and spend them to activate up to 2 different Blessings of Khorne, each die paying for one Blessing. Leftover dice are discarded. Each active Blessing applies until the round ends to all your units that have this ability:\n\n- **Unbridled Bloodlust** (any double): those units get +1 to **charge rolls**.\n- **Rage-Fuelled Invigoration** (double 2+): Pile-in and **Consolidation moves** by its models can each be up to 6\" rather than 3\".\n- **Total Carnage** (double 3+): when a melee attack destroys a model that is yet to fight this phase, roll a D6; on a 4+ it stays in play, may fight once the attacking unit's attacks are done, then is removed.\n- **Martial Excellence** (double 4+ or any triple): melee weapons get **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**.\n- **Warp Blades** (double 5+ or triple 2+): melee weapons get **[[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits)**.\n- **Decapitating Strikes** (double 6 or triple 3+): melee attacks against **INFANTRY** units get **[[DEVASTATING WOUNDS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/devastating-wounds)**.",
